# Force LF on checkout for all text files, regardless of platform or a
# developer's local core.autocrlf setting. Without this, Lambda zips built
# by `archive_file`/`file()` reading straight off disk hash differently on
# Windows (CRLF working tree) vs. CI's Linux runners (LF) — same source,
# different deployed bytes. Binary files are unaffected (git's text=auto
# still auto-detects and skips them).
* text=auto eol=lf
